{"id":"braut","lemma":"Braut","pos":"noun","rank":1314,"glosses":["bride; a woman taking part in a marriage","a girlfriend; a young woman; a broad"],"ipa":"/bʁaʊ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/De-Braut.ogg/De-Braut.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Braut","plural":"Bräute","masculine":"Bräutigam"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie dürfen die Braut küssen.","en":"You may kiss the bride.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698531","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to be allowed"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to kiss"}]},{"text":"Die Braut sah sehr schön aus.","en":"The bride looked very beautiful.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"well, beautifully"},{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Am Tage ihrer Hochzeit sind alle Bräute schön.","en":"All brides are beautiful on their wedding days.","words":[{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"period"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},{"g":"wedding, marriage"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,{"g":"well, beautifully"}]},{"text":"Trinken wir auf die Braut!","en":"Let's drink to the bride.","words":[{"g":"to drink by mouth)"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Braut lachte plötzlich.","en":"The bride suddenly laughed.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to laugh","l":"lachen"},{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"}]}]}